@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `law08-vintage`
IMPORT `law08-nouns`

-- Chuong III, Muc 1, Dieu 62-63: the forms an insurer may take, the content of its activity, and
-- the types of insurance it may carry on. Dieu 63(3) is amended by Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(2)
-- (points (b) and (c)), so it has one arm per vintage. Dieu 15(2) in Chuong II reads Dieu 63(3).

§ `Chuong III: Doanh nghiep bao hiem, doanh nghiep tai bao hiem, chi nhanh nuoc ngoai tai Viet Nam`

§§ `Dieu 62: forms of organisation`

@@q 1135 1138
@ref Dieu 62 (src:1135-1138)
GIVEN f IS A `A form of organisation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 62: the form is one an insurer or reinsurer may take` f MEANS
    CONSIDER f
    WHEN `a joint stock company`          THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a limited liability company`    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `another form of organisation`   THEN FALSE

§§ `Dieu 63: content of the activity`

-- Dieu 63(1) is the content of an insurer's or a foreign non-life branch's activity; Dieu 63(2)
-- of a reinsurer's or a foreign reinsurer's branch's. The kinds of insurer are those of Dieu 4.
@@q 1141 1153
@ref Dieu 63 (src:1141-1153)
GIVEN k IS A `A kind of insurer`
      a IS A `A line of activity`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 63(1)-(2): the line of activity is within the content of the kind of insurer` k a MEANS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `a life insurer`                          THEN `the line is within Dieu 63(1)` a
    WHEN `a non-life insurer`                      THEN `the line is within Dieu 63(1)` a
    WHEN `a health insurer`                        THEN `the line is within Dieu 63(1)` a
    WHEN `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer`  THEN `the line is within Dieu 63(1)` a
    WHEN `a reinsurer`                             THEN `the line is within Dieu 63(2)` a
    WHEN `a branch of a foreign reinsurer`         THEN `the line is within Dieu 63(2)` a
    WHEN `a microinsurance mutual organisation`    THEN REFUSE "Dieu 63 does not govern a microinsurance mutual organisation; Chuong V does (Dieu 148-150)"

GIVEN a IS A `A line of activity`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the line is within Dieu 63(1)` a MEANS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `insurance business, reinsurance business and ceding`            THEN TRUE
    WHEN `managing funds and investing capital from insurance business`   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `supplying ancillary insurance services`                         THEN TRUE
    WHEN `another activity directly related to insurance business`        THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN a IS A `A line of activity`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the line is within Dieu 63(2)` a MEANS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `reinsurance business and ceding`                                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `managing funds and investing capital from reinsurance business`       THEN TRUE
    WHEN `another activity directly related to reinsurance business`            THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- Dieu 63(3). An insurer or foreign non-life branch may carry on one type of insurance only,
-- apart from three exceptions. Points (b) and (c) are replaced by Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(2) from
-- 1 January 2026: "bao hiem cho rui ro tu vong" (insurance for the risk of death) becomes "bao
-- hiem tu ky" (term insurance). "tu 01 nam tro xuong" is read as a term of 12 months or less (F6).
@@q 1154 1163
@@qa 32 39
@ref Dieu 63 (src:1154-1163; src:law139-2025-qh15:32-39)
GIVEN k IS A `A kind of insurer`
GIVETH A `A type of insurance`
`the type of insurance the kind of insurer carries on (Dieu 63(3))` k MEANS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `a life insurer`                          THEN `life insurance`
    WHEN `a non-life insurer`                      THEN `non-life insurance`
    WHEN `a health insurer`                        THEN `health insurance`
    WHEN `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer`  THEN `non-life insurance`
    OTHERWISE REFUSE "Dieu 63(3) governs insurers and foreign non-life branches only"

GIVEN k IS A `A kind of insurer`
      p IS A `A product offered`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the product is permitted for the kind of insurer (Dieu 63(3))` k p MEANS
        p's `type of insurance` EQUALS `the type of insurance the kind of insurer carries on (Dieu 63(3))` k
    OR  (    k EQUALS `a life insurer`
         AND p's `type of insurance` EQUALS `health insurance`)
    OR  (    (k EQUALS `a non-life insurer` OR k EQUALS `a branch of a foreign non-life insurer`)
         AND `the product is a short health product or a short death-risk product` p)
    OR  (    k EQUALS `a health insurer`
         AND `the product is a short death-risk product` p)

GIVEN p IS A `A product offered`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the product is a short health product or a short death-risk product` p MEANS
        (p's `type of insurance` EQUALS `health insurance` AND p's `term in months` AT MOST 12)
    OR  `the product is a short death-risk product` p

GIVEN p IS A `A product offered`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the product is a short death-risk product` p MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the rules in force are those of V2 or later`
           THEN p's `is a term-life product` AND p's `term in months` AT MOST 12
           IF `the rules in force are those of V1 or later`
           THEN p's `covers the risk of death` AND p's `term in months` AT MOST 12
           OTHERWISE REFUSE "Law 08/2022/QH15 was not in force before 1 January 2023"

GIVEN b IS A `The business of an insurer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 63(3): the business combines only the types of insurance the Law permits` b MEANS
    all (GIVEN p YIELD `the product is permitted for the kind of insurer (Dieu 63(3))` (b's `kind of insurer`) p) (b's `products offered`)
